  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'd very much like an option to have a 'list' of the current sounds being played and their origins, in my UI.  When there's a very loud or unpleasant noise it's hard to figure out where it's coming from, and this would make it much easier.  We had somebody hiding in our world playing incredibly racist soundbites in global audio, and nobody could figure out how to get it to stop or who was doing it.\n\nHaving a list of 'Who is making what sounds' on the side of my UI with easy access to 'enter' and mute/adjust them, one audio track at a time, would be lovely. Thank you.",
